## O. Preliminary Understanding of the Future System
The final codebase will be a modular, Dockerized microservices ecosystem. It will consist of a **Data Generation & Ingestion Pipeline** (Python/PyBaMM), an **AI/ML Engine** (PyTorch, exposing FastAPI endpoints for inference), a **Blockchain Network** (Hyperledger Fabric nodes running chaincode), a **Storage Layer** (TimescaleDB and ChromaDB), and a **Frontend Dashboard** (React). The system will act as a passive overlay, ingesting CAN data, enriching it with AI insights, securing it on a ledger, and serving it via RAG.

